So good.

00:23:18.112 --> 00:23:19.195
It's so good.

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:25.870
- Oh, good afternoon, sir,

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:26.703
how can I help you?

00:23:26.703 --> 00:23:31.610
- Well, Davis, I will
be staying indefinitely.

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:36.517
- But sir, don't you know
that you've always been here?

00:23:36.517 --> 00:23:39.267
(romantic music)

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:43.073
- Really?

00:23:43.073 --> 00:23:44.470
- Mm-hmm.

00:23:44.470 --> 00:23:45.763
- Continental breakfast?

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.293
- Right around the corner.

00:24:13.948 --> 00:24:16.531
(upbeat music)

00:24:18.977 --> 00:24:21.409
♪ All I want yeah ♪

00:24:21.409 --> 00:24:23.449
♪ But I don't need ya ♪

